    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1Lq6Qk-rT-gBVRyy1ziY69Sw74.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>圣诞快乐！在这个圣诞节我们集结了16家成都播客，一同打破“次元”，邀请你走上街头，和成都播客一起走上街头，开启一场寻宝之旅！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🥳游戏规则：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>根据节目中各位主播的提示，拍下一张和主播相同（或相似）的照片（就在时间线里快往下看~），投递在即刻推文的评论区，第一名提交的拍得最接近的听众将获得该播客为你准备的圣诞礼物哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>16家播客，16张照片，16个成都角落，16份礼物，送给16位听众~</span></p><span></span><p><span>*注：为了让更多朋友分享到这份圣诞祝福，每位听众只会获得1个播客提供的奖品。如果说符合多家播客的获奖要求，只获得提交的第一个播客的礼物，其他播客获奖者顺延至下一位。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💌投递链接：</span></strong><a href="https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6584cb6371cfacf609a0ab4d?s=ewoidSI6ICI2MmVhMDg1MWI3ZWIwZjk5NWY3NGFjZDMiCn0=" data-url="https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6584cb6371cfacf609a0ab4d?s=ewoidSI6ICI2MmVhMDg1MWI3ZWIwZjk5NWY3NGFjZDMiCn0="><span>点击跳转哟</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>（小宇宙还不能评论图片，辛苦大家移步即刻投递啦嘿嘿）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📷时间线&amp;成都播客“城市摄影展:D”：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">2:25</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63f5d328671f777417a6a9c2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63f5d328671f777417a6a9c2"><span>案IN司谈</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">3:35</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643b8f2a14c57de144209564" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643b8f2a14c57de144209564"><span>八八摆摆</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">5:59</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6390a0a8cb880048eb32f4cf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6390a0a8cb880048eb32f4cf"><span>不敢高声语LivingOutLoud</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">8:57</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62e7802e818e054ae3c10ff3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62e7802e818e054ae3c10ff3"><span>多云转晴</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">9:43</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647881c61b6d11cd062a85ca" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647881c61b6d11cd062a85ca"><span>罐装乐园</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/635e1edea52a47b7fb2f2d3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/635e1edea52a47b7fb2f2d3a"><span>海椒Radio</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60acac17cd0329ebb0a9243b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60acac17cd0329ebb0a9243b"><span>鲸鱼赫兹</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/616fd98c7e390a2de9e02098" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/616fd98c7e390a2de9e02098"><span>绝对领域</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60aa0a12e008dd38765ed64a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60aa0a12e008dd38765ed64a"><span>可猴Radio</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61e0999093bf927a43733769" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61e0999093bf927a43733769"><span>马上开摆</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5fb1dfe183c34e85dd784bbb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5fb1dfe183c34e85dd784bbb"><span>青年度日指南</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1768">29:28</a></span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64801df453a5e5ea141558d6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64801df453a5e5ea141558d6"><span> 她的脉播</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6300f3f22427ab3f84afacc4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6300f3f22427ab3f84afacc4"><span>体制内 | 小职员们的聊天局</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64a1063ebe70890de99bacbe" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64a1063ebe70890de99bacbe"><span>微醺一大口</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/624e827e4e04e8f7749eac00" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/624e827e4e04e8f7749eac00"><span>小刘同学</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60eb16af030f8753b998204b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60eb16af030f8753b998204b"><span>野地电波</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎁礼物大赏：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（每位获奖听众都会获得中间的“播客大礼包”！其他边边上的小礼物，是由主播自己准备的小心意，会根据所投递的播客，随机掉落哦~）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>最后，再次祝大家圣诞快乐，元旦快乐，新年快乐，每天快乐🎄</span></p><span></span><p><span>▪️ 勤劳的制作统筹：susu</span></p><span></span><p><span>▪️ 伟大的视觉设计：可猴</span></p><span></span><p><span>▪️ 特别要感谢一下：Y、小熊</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>关于芳草街D口：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>芳草街D口是由成都多家播客共同创作运营的“团综”播客，目的是想要打破结界，让声音走进真实世界，不再做电波之上的网友，我们见面吧！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>在这里你可以听到，成都在地播客的超级联动、体验纪实、城市探索、声音记录、以及还在挖掘的新形态播客！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>如果说各位听众朋友们有什么想听的想玩的，对于团综播客的好点子，欢迎在评论区告诉我们。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>如果说你也是一名在成都的播客主播的话，欢迎在评论区联系我们</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>以后常见❤</span></blockquote><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
